            </div>


            <div class="r154-advance-paid-steps">

                <article class="r154-advance-paid-step">

                    <span class="r154-advance-paid-number">
                        Stage 01
                    </span>

                    <h3>
                        Verify Eligibility
                    </h3>

                    <p>
                        Review current age, training, risk-management and
                        registration requirements.
                    </p>

                </article>


                <article class="r154-advance-paid-step">

                    <span class="r154-advance-paid-number">
                        Stage 02
                    </span>

                    <h3>
                        Earn the License
                    </h3>

                    <p>
                        Complete the current U.S. Soccer and Cal South referee
                        licensing process.
                    </p>

                </article>


                <article class="r154-advance-paid-step">

                    <span class="r154-advance-paid-number">
                        Stage 03
                    </span>

                    <h3>
                        Confirm Good Standing
                    </h3>

                    <p>
                        Verify that all current requirements are approved and
                        visible in the applicable records.
                    </p>

                </article>


                <article class="r154-advance-paid-step">

                    <span class="r154-advance-paid-number">
                        Stage 04
                    </span>

                    <h3>
                        Join an Association
                    </h3>

                    <p>
                        Complete NOCRA or another approved association’s current
                        onboarding process.
                    </p>

                </article>


                <article class="r154-advance-paid-step">

                    <span class="r154-advance-paid-number">
                        Stage 05
                    </span>

                    <h3>
                        Build Experience
                    </h3>

                    <p>
                        Accept appropriate matches, attend education and earn
                        increasingly challenging assignments.
                    </p>

                </article>

